  "prefLabel": "Rev 803.07 Leases",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 803.07 Leases. The tax imposed by RSA 78-B shall not apply to the transfer of a lease where the term of the lease, including all renewals, is less than 99 years pursuant to RSA 78-B:2, XX.\n\nSource. #11005, eff 12-23-15; ss by 14071, eff 9-10-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev800.html"
